{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33953","headline":"偶成小酌招鲁望不至以诗爲解因次韵詶之 · 皮日休","name":"偶成小酌招鲁望不至以诗爲解因次韵詶之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"醉侣相邀爱早阳，小筵催办不胜忙。\n冲深柳驻吴娃幰，倚短花排羯鼓牀。\n金凤欲爲莺引去，钿蝉疑被蝶勾将。\n如何共是忘形者，不见渔阳掺一场。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33953.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33953","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}